      "text": "Exception to the SteadyGrowth board rate: deposits funded via FAST transfer are not eligible for the 3.20% p.a. board rate and earn the 2.60% p.a. standard rate instead. This exception overrides the general rule in FD-101 for FAST-funded deposits.",
